    "body": "Advances the P1 authorization/privacy/IDOR audit (#957; related #615/#618/#620).\n\n- Require a persistent authenticated user id before `/users/me`, `/users/me/profile`, and `/users/me/password` reach account services.\n- Convert missing/transient principals into the existing controlled forbidden path instead of allowing null-id dereferences or downstream account operations.\n- Add regression coverage proving zero service/session/cookie interactions for missing or transient identities.\n\nMerge gate: exact-head CI/reviews/master freshness must be green before merge.",
